<script>

  let d = $data(() => __rvLoad("admin.session", {}));
</script>

<head>
  <title>备份恢复 - 管理后台</title>
</head>

<div class="adm-toolbar">
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;">
    <span class="adm-ic" style="--i:url(/public/icons/database-backup.svg);width:20px;height:20px;color:#818cf8;"></span>
    <strong style="font-size:16px">备份恢复</strong>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="adm-card" style="margin-bottom:16px;">
  <div class="adm-card-hd"><strong style="font-size:14px;">下载备份</strong></div>
  <div class="adm-card-bd">
    <p class="adm-hint" style="margin:0 0 12px;">全量备份（ZIP）包含全部业务表 + content/uploads 下的全部媒体文件，换机可完整还原；整库备份（JSON）仅含业务表原始行，体积小、适合频繁留档。两者都可在「恢复」卡片上传还原。</p>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
    <a class="adm-btn" href="/api/admin/backup?full=1" download><span class="adm-ic adm-ic-sm" style="--i:url(/public/icons/download.svg)"></span>全量备份（含媒体）</a>
    <a class="adm-btn adm-btn-ghost" href="/api/admin/backup" download><span class="adm-ic adm-ic-sm" style="--i:url(/public/icons/download.svg)"></span>整库备份（JSON）</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="adm-card" style="margin-bottom:16px;">
  <div class="adm-card-hd"><strong style="font-size:14px;">从备份恢复</strong></div>
  <div class="adm-card-bd">
    <p class="adm-hint" style="margin:0 0 12px;color:#f87171;">破坏性操作：恢复会清空当前全部业务数据，整库替换为备份时刻的状态。恢复前系统会自动把当前库快照保存到服务器 .data/backups 目录（保留最近 10 份）。</p>
    <form data-adm-form="backup-restore">
      <div class="adm-field">
        <label>备份文件（oboext-db-backup-*.json）</label>
        <input class="adm-input" type="file" name="file" accept=".json,application/json" required>
      </div>
      <div class="adm-field" style="margin-top:12px;">
        <label>确认词（输入 RESTORE）</label>
        <input class="adm-input" name="confirm" placeholder="RESTORE" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" style="max-width:220px;" required>
      </div>
      <p class="adm-hint" style="margin:12px 0 12px;color:#f87171;" data-adm-msg></p>
      <button class="adm-btn" type="submit" style="background:#dc2626;">执行恢复</button>
    </form>
    <p class="adm-hint" style="margin:12px 0 0;">恢复完成后全部缓存即已失效、插件按新数据重载；若当前登录失效，请用备份中的管理员账号重新登录。</p>
  </div>
</div>
